Comment: Official Thermal Grizzly WireView Pro II firmware image,
 redistributed unmodified from the upstream WireView2 Windows release (see
 firmware/README.md). Installed as /usr/share/wireview/TG-WV-PRO2-FW.hex for
 "wireviewctl flash"; it runs on the device, never on the host.

